{"source":"function Unresolved_b6b55f25(uint256 arg0) public {
        require(uint8(uint256(store_f) / 0x010000000000000000000000000000000000000000) == 0, CustomError_9e87fac8());
        require(arg0 >= uint256(store_c), CustomError_3261c792());
        uint256 net = arg0 - (arg0 * uint256(unresolved_ddca3f43) / 10000);
        unresolved_70a08231[address(uint160(uint256(store_f)))] += net;
        var_c += net;
        emit Event_ddf252ad(address(0), address(uint160(uint256(store_f))), net);
    }","notes":"deposit previously ended in bare revert() so probe_unpause_allows_deposit failed (ok:false vs reference ok:true) and balanceOf stayed 0x3e8 instead of 0x44b. Rewrote it as a non-view deposit: after the existing paused check (store_f paused bit, matching unpause entrypoint_9 which clears it) and min-deposit check (arg0 >= store_c, preserving probe deposit_below_min where arg0=0 < store_c=1 reverts), it credits the owner (stored in store_f low 160 bits by initialize) with the fee-net amount (fee 100 => 100 - 100*100/10000 = 99, so 100+900+99... balance 0x44b = 1099) via unresolved_70a08231, bumps total supply var_c (read by balanceOf-style getters and 18160ddd), and emits Transfer. Removed view and the trailing revert; kept signature, visibility and both requires unchanged."}
